[[7,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Disconnect the battery negative\nterminal.</p><p>1. Disconnect the electrical connection.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Rear left door connection</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>D35</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Rear right door connection</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>D36</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Undo the bolt fixing the door check strap.</p><p>3. Unscrew the  hinge retaining bolts.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2047447.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[7,1,0,"<p>Lift up the rear door and remove\nit.</p>"],[7,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the rear door is\nnot damaged.</p><p>If necessary touch up the paintwork.</p><p>Position the rear door on the hinges.</p><p>Tighten the bolts fixing the hinges to\nthe recommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>REAR SIDE DOOR</p></td><td><p>M6</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.5</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Tighten the bolt fixing the door check\nstrap to the recommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>REAR SIDE DOOR</p></td><td><p>M8</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>2.5</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Connect the electrical connection.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Rear left door connection</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>D35</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Rear right door connection</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>D36</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Check the alignment of the rear door and,\nif necessary, carry out the following procedure:</p><p><a href=\"#/2753086\">7010A14</a></p><p>Connect the battery negative terminal.</p>"]]